(https://github.com/nicholas-fedor/watchtower, originally
https://github.com/containrrr/watchtower), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. See LICENSE.md.

Modifications in this fork (https://github.com/rpeters1430/watchtower):

- A web UI built into the Watchtower binary and served by its HTTP API.
- Settings that can be changed while Watchtower runs (/v1/settings).
- Update checks recorded in the scan history, and settings and history kept
  in a data directory (--data-dir) across restarts.
- A container image published to ghcr.io/rpeters1430/watchtower.
- A standalone dashboard prototype (dashboard/).

The full list of changes is in the Git history of this repository.

